<node id="d8d0da96-b065-45fe-bbc8-b9e25338f081">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Index Crediting &amp; Allocation Structure","text":"100%\n       Floor: 0% | Crediting Period: 1 year\n    \n    C) Global Diversified Index Account\n       Current Cap: 8.5% | Participation Rate: 100%\n       Floor: 0% | Crediting Period: 1 year\n\n2.2 FIXED ACCOUNT:\n    Guaranteed interest rate: 3.0% annually\n    No cap, no floor variability\n\n2.3 CURRENT ALLOCATION:\n    S&amp;P 500 Index: 50%\n    NASDAQ-100 Index: 30%\n    Fixed Account: 20%\n\n2.4 You may change allocations on any policy anniversary at no \n    charge. First 4 reallocations per year are free; $25 fee \n    thereafter.\n\n2.5 GUARANTEED RATES: While current caps and participation rates \n    are shown above, we guarantee:\n    • Caps will never be less than 4%\n    • Participation rates will never be less than 25%\n    • Fixed account will never be less than 2%\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 3 - HOW INDEX CREDITING WORKS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n3.1 CREDITING CALCULATION:\n    On each policy anniversary, we calculate:\n    \n    Index % Change = (Ending Index Value - Starting Index Value) \n                     ÷ Starting Index Value\n    \n    Interest Credited = Index % Change × Participation Rate\n                       (subject to Cap and Floor)\n\n3.2 EXAMPLE:\n    Assume S&amp;P 500 Index:\n    • Started at 4,000\n    • Ended at 4,600\n    • Gain: 15%\n    • With 100% participation and 10.5% cap\n    • Interest credited: 10.5% (capped)\n    \n    If index declined 5%:\n    • Floor protects at 0%\n    • Interest credited: 0% (no loss)\n\n3.3 CRITICAL: You never lose money due to market decline. The \n    worst case is","summary":"This document details the crediting mechanism for a variable annuity-like product, featuring three accounts: two indexed (Global Diversified Index and S&amp;P 500/NASDAQ-based), and one fixed account with a guaranteed 3% annual return. Indexed gains are capped and subject to participation rates but protected by a 0% floor—ensuring no losses during market declines. Investors can freely adjust their portfolio allocation up to four times yearly without fees, with additional changes costing $25. Minimum guarantees ensure caps stay ≥4%, participation rates ≥25%, and fixed account yields ≥2%.","topics":["Index Crediting","Guaranteed Returns","Asset Allocation","Market Protection"],"facts":[{"name":"Global Diversified Index Cap","sentence":"The Global Diversified Index Account has a current cap of 8.5%.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Global Diversified Index Account","Current Cap","Index Crediting"],"entities":[{"name":"Global Diversified Index Account","type":"ACCOUNT","role":"index-linked growth vehicle","relational_anchors":["Current Cap: 8.5%","Participation Rate: 100%","Floor: 0%","Crediting Period: 1 year"]},{"name":"Fixed Account","type":"ACCOUNT","role":"guaranteed return component","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed interest rate: 3.0% annually","No cap, no floor variability"]},{"name":"S&amp;P 500 Index","type":"INDEX","role":"primary benchmark for gains","relational_anchors":["50%","Started at 4,000","Ended at 4,600","Gain: 15%"]},{"name":"NASDAQ-100 Index","type":"INDEX","role":"secondary benchmark for gains","relational_anchors":["30%"]},{"name":"8.5%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"maximum creditable gain limit","relational_anchors":["Current Cap: 8.5%","Global Diversified Index Account"]},{"name":"100%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"full participation in index movement","relational_anchors":["Participation Rate: 100%","Global Diversified Index Account"]},{"name":"0%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"minimum guaranteed return level","relational_anchors":["Floor: 0%","Global Diversified Index Account","Protection against losses"]},{"name":"1 year","type":"TIME_PERIOD","role":"crediting cycle duration","relational_anchors":["Crediting Period: 1 year","Policy anniversary"]},{"name":"Policy Anniversary","type":"EVENT","role":"timing point for recalculations","relational_anchors":["On each policy anniversary","Change allocations","Reallocate funds"]},{"name":"$25 fee","type":"FEES","role":"penalty after free reallocations","relational_anchors":["First 4 reallocations per year are free","Thereafter"]},{"name":"Caps will never be less than 4%","type":"GUARANTEE","role":"floor protection for maximum credits","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed Rates","Never below 4%"]},{"name":"Participation rates will never be less than 25%","type":"GUARANTEE","role":"minimum sharing ratio in gains","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed Rates","Never below 25%"]},{"name":"Fixed account will never be less than 2%","type":"GUARANTEE","role":"baseline minimum yield assurance","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed Rates","Never below 2%"]}]},{"name":"Participation Rate: 100%","sentence":"The Global Diversified Index Account has a participation rate of 100%.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Global Diversified Index Account","participation rate","index crediting"],"entities":[{"name":"Global Diversified Index Account","type":"ACCOUNT","role":"index-linked growth vehicle","relational_anchors":["Current Cap: 8.5%","Participation Rate: 100%","Floor: 0%","Crediting Period: 1 year"]},{"name":"Fixed Account","type":"ACCOUNT","role":"guaranteed return component","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed interest rate: 3.0% annually","No cap, no floor variability"]},{"name":"S&amp;P 500 Index","type":"INDEX","role":"primary benchmark for gains","relational_anchors":["50%","Started at 4,000","Ended at 4,600","Gain: 15%"]},{"name":"NASDAQ-100 Index","type":"INDEX","role":"secondary benchmark for gains","relational_anchors":["30%"]},{"name":"8.5%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"maximum creditable gain limit","relational_anchors":["Current Cap: 8.5%","Global Diversified Index Account"]},{"name":"100%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"full participation in index movement","relational_anchors":["Participation Rate: 100%","Global Diversified Index Account"]},{"name":"0%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"minimum guaranteed return level","relational_anchors":["Floor: 0%","Global Diversified Index Account","Protection against losses"]},{"name":"1 year","type":"TIME_PERIOD","role":"crediting cycle duration","relational_anchors":["Crediting Period: 1 year","Policy anniversary"]},{"name":"Policy Anniversary","type":"EVENT","role":"timing point for recalculations","relational_anchors":["On each policy anniversary","Change allocations","Reallocate funds"]},{"name":"$25 fee","type":"FEES","role":"penalty after free reallocations","relational_anchors":["First 4 reallocations per year are free","Thereafter"]},{"name":"Caps will never be less than 4%","type":"GUARANTEE","role":"floor protection for maximum credits","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed Rates","Never below 4%"]},{"name":"Participation rates will never be less than 25%","type":"GUARANTEE","role":"minimum sharing ratio in gains","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed Rates","Never below 25%"]},{"name":"Fixed account will never be less than 2%","type":"GUARANTEE","role":"baseline minimum yield assurance","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed Rates","Never below 2%"]}]},{"name":"Floor Protection Guarantee","sentence":"The Global Diversified Index Account has a floor of 0%.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["floor of 0%","market downturn protection","index crediting mechanism"],"entities":[{"name":"Global Diversified Index Account","type":"ACCOUNT","role":"index-linked growth vehicle","relational_anchors":["Current Cap: 8.5%","Participation Rate: 100%","Floor: 0%","Crediting Period: 1 year"]},{"name":"Fixed Account","type":"ACCOUNT","role":"guaranteed return component","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed interest rate: 3.0% annually","No cap, no floor variability"]},{"name":"S&amp;P 500 Index","type":"INDEX","role":"primary benchmark for gains","relational_anchors":["50%","Started at 4,000","Ended at 4,600","Gain: 15%"]},{"name":"NASDAQ-100 Index","type":"INDEX","role":"secondary benchmark for gains","relational_anchors":["30%"]},{"name":"8.5%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"maximum creditable gain limit","relational_anchors":["Current Cap: 8.5%","Global Diversified Index Account"]},{"name":"100%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"full participation in index movement","relational_anchors":["Participation Rate: 100%","Global Diversified Index Account"]},{"name":"0%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"minimum guaranteed return level","relational_anchors":["Floor: 0%","Global Diversified Index Account","Protection against losses"]},{"name":"1 year","type":"TIME_PERIOD","role":"crediting cycle duration","relational_anchors":["Crediting Period: 1 year","Policy anniversary"]},{"name":"Policy Anniversary","type":"EVENT","role":"timing point for recalculations","relational_anchors":["On each policy anniversary","Change allocations","Reallocate funds"]},{"name":"$25 fee","type":"FEES","role":"penalty after free reallocations","relational_anchors":["First 4 reallocations per year are free","Thereafter"]},{"name":"Caps will never be less than 4%","type":"GUARANTEE","role":"floor protection for maximum credits","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed Rates","Never below 4%"]},{"name":"Participation rates will never be less than 25%","type":"GUARANTEE","role":"minimum sharing ratio in gains","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed Rates","Never below 25%"]},{"name":"Fixed account will never be less than 2%","type":"GUARANTEE","role":"baseline minimum yield assurance","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed Rates","Never below 2%"]}]},{"name":"Crediting Period: 1 Year","sentence":"The Global Diversified Index Account has a crediting period of 1 year.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Global Diversified Index Account","crediting period","index accounting"],"entities":[{"name":"Global Diversified Index Account","type":"ACCOUNT","role":"index-linked growth vehicle","relational_anchors":["Current Cap: 8.5%","Participation Rate: 100%","Floor: 0%","Crediting Period: 1 year