<node id="13fd241e-902f-4911-bb6b-9f0c8e8565dd">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Life Insurance Policy Features","text":"    \n    If index declined 5%:\n    • Floor protects at 0%\n    • Interest credited: 0% (no loss)\n\n3.3 CRITICAL: You never lose money due to market decline. The \n    worst case is 0% interest for that year.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 4 - PREMIUM FLEXIBILITY\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n4.1 You may pay premiums at any time in any amount between:\n    Minimum: $100 per payment\n    Maximum: $50,000 per year (tax qualification limit)\n\n4.2 PLANNED PREMIUM: $6,000 annually is recommended to maintain \n    coverage to age 100 based on current assumptions.\n\n4.3 You may skip premium payments as long as account value is \n    sufficient to cover monthly deductions.\n\n4.4 PREMIUM LOAD: 3.5% of each premium payment is deducted for \n    expenses.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 5 - MONTHLY POLICY CHARGES\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n5.1 Cost of Insurance (COI):\n    Deducted monthly based on:\n    (Death Benefit - Account Value) × Monthly COI Rate ÷ 1,000\n\n5.2 Administrative Charge: $12 per month\n\n5.3 Total charges are deducted from account value on the 3rd of \n    each month.\n\n5.4 COI rates are guaranteed not to exceed rates shown in the \n    policy schedule.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 6 - DEATH BENEFIT OPTIONS\n════════════════════════════","summary":"This document details critical aspects of a life insurance policy, including guaranteed protection against market downturns—ensuring no loss even if the index drops by 5%. Premiums can be paid flexibly between $100 and $50,000 annually, with a recommended annual contribution of $6,000 to sustain coverage until age 100. A 3.5% load applies to each premium payment, while monthly charges include cost-of-insurance and an administrative fee of $12, both deducted from the account value. Death benefit options are available but not detailed here.","topics":["Market Protection","Premium Flexibility","Policy Charges","Death Benefit Options"],"facts":[{"name":"Floor Protection Guarantee","sentence":"If the index declines by 5%, the floor protection ensures no negative return.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["floor protection","market decline","capital preservation"],"entities":[{"name":"floor","type":"CONCEPT","role":"minimum protection level","relational_anchors":["protects at 0%"]},{"name":"interest credited","type":"CONCEPT","role":"annual rate applied to account","relational_anchors":["0%","no loss"]},{"name":"market decline","type":"CONCEPT","role":"trigger condition for floor activation","relational_anchors":["declined 5%"]},{"name":"$100","type":"AMOUNT","role":"minimum payment threshold","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$50,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"maximum annual contribution limit","relational_anchors":["per year","tax qualification limit"]},{"name":"$6,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"recommended planned premium","relational_anchors":["annually","to maintain coverage to age 100"]},{"name":"3.5%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"premium load percentage","relational_anchors":["of each premium payment","deducted for expenses"]},{"name":"Premium Load","type":"CHARGE","role":"expense deduction from premium","relational_anchors":["3.5%","deducted for expenses"]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance (COI)","type":"CHARGE","role":"monthly death benefit cost charge","relational_anchors":["Deducted monthly","based on (Death Benefit - Account Value) × Monthly COI Rate ÷ 1,000"]},{"name":"Administrative Charge","type":"CHARGE","role":"fixed monthly fee","relational_anchors":["$12 per month"]},{"name":"the 3rd","type":"DATE","role":"deduction date for total charges","relational_anchors":["each month","Total charges are deducted"]}]},{"name":"Floor Protection Level","sentence":"The floor protection level is set at 0%.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["floor protection","market decline safeguard","zero percent floor"],"entities":[{"name":"floor","type":"CONCEPT","role":"minimum protection level","relational_anchors":["protects at 0%"]},{"name":"interest credited","type":"CONCEPT","role":"annual rate applied to account","relational_anchors":["0%","no loss"]},{"name":"market decline","type":"CONCEPT","role":"trigger condition for floor activation","relational_anchors":["declined 5%"]},{"name":"$100","type":"AMOUNT","role":"minimum payment threshold","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$50,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"maximum annual contribution limit","relational_anchors":["per year","tax qualification limit"]},{"name":"$6,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"recommended planned premium","relational_anchors":["annually","to maintain coverage to age 100"]},{"name":"3.5%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"premium load percentage","relational_anchors":["of each premium payment","deducted for expenses"]},{"name":"Premium Load","type":"CHARGE","role":"expense deduction from premium","relational_anchors":["3.5%","deducted for expenses"]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance (COI)","type":"CHARGE","role":"monthly death benefit cost charge","relational_anchors":["Deducted monthly","based on (Death Benefit - Account Value) × Monthly COI Rate ÷ 1,000"]},{"name":"Administrative Charge","type":"CHARGE","role":"fixed monthly fee","relational_anchors":["$12 per month"]},{"name":"the 3rd","type":"DATE","role":"deduction date for total charges","relational_anchors":["each month","Total charges are deducted"]}]},{"name":"Index Decline Protection","sentence":"When the index declines by 5%, the interest credited to the account is 0%.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["index decline","interest crediting","floor protection"],"entities":[{"name":"floor","type":"CONCEPT","role":"minimum protection level","relational_anchors":["protects at 0%"]},{"name":"interest credited","type":"CONCEPT","role":"annual rate applied to account","relational_anchors":["0%","no loss"]},{"name":"market decline","type":"CONCEPT","role":"trigger condition for floor activation","relational_anchors":["declined 5%"]},{"name":"$100","type":"AMOUNT","role":"minimum payment threshold","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$50,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"maximum annual contribution limit","relational_anchors":["per year","tax qualification limit"]},{"name":"$6,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"recommended planned premium","relational_anchors":["annually","to maintain coverage to age 100"]},{"name":"3.5%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"premium load percentage","relational_anchors":["of each premium payment","deducted for expenses"]},{"name":"Premium Load","type":"CHARGE","role":"expense deduction from premium","relational_anchors":["3.5%","deducted for expenses"]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance (COI)","type":"CHARGE","role":"monthly death benefit cost charge","relational_anchors":["Deducted monthly","based on (Death Benefit - Account Value) × Monthly COI Rate ÷ 1,000"]},{"name":"Administrative Charge","type":"CHARGE","role":"fixed monthly fee","relational_anchors":["$12 per month"]},{"name":"the 3rd","type":"DATE","role":"deduction date for total charges","relational_anchors":["each month","Total charges are deducted"]}]},{"name":"Market Loss Protection","sentence":"A market decline does not result in a loss of principal.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["principal protection","market decline","zero interest floor"],"entities":[{"name":"floor","type":"CONCEPT","role":"minimum protection level","relational_anchors":["protects at 0%"]},{"name":"interest credited","type":"CONCEPT","role":"annual rate applied to account","relational_anchors":["0%","no loss"]},{"name":"market decline","type":"CONCEPT","role":"trigger condition for floor activation","relational_anchors":["declined 5%"]},{"name":"$100","type":"AMOUNT","role":"minimum payment threshold","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$50,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"ma