  <data key="d0">{"name":"Death Benefit &amp; Financial Flexibility Terms","text":"═════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 6 - DEATH BENEFIT OPTIONS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n6.1 OPTION 1 - Level Death Benefit (CURRENT)\n    Death Benefit = $500,000 (specified amount)\n    Lower ongoing charges\n\n6.2 OPTION 2 - Increasing Death Benefit\n    Death Benefit = Specified Amount + Account Value\n    Higher ongoing charges, benefit grows with account\n\n6.3 You may change options on any anniversary with 60 days notice.\n    Evidence of insurability required to increase coverage.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 7 - LOANS AND WITHDRAWALS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n7.1 POLICY LOANS:\n    • Available after 1 year\n    • Maximum: 90% of surrender value\n    • Loan interest: 4% annually (fixed loan rate)\n    • Loaned amounts earn fixed account rate (3%)\n    • Net cost: 1% annually\n\n7.2 PARTIAL WITHDRAWALS:\n    • Minimum: $500\n    • Maximum: Account value minus surrender charge\n    • First 10 withdrawals free; $50 fee thereafter\n    • Reduces death benefit dollar-for-dollar under Option 1\n\n7.3 Outstanding loans reduce death benefit at time of claim.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 8 - SURRENDER CHARGES\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n8.1 If you surrender within first 12 years:\n\n    Year 1: 10% | Year 4: 7% | Year 7: ","summary":"This document details death benefit choices—Level ($500,000) and Increasing (specification plus account value)—with differing fees and growth potential. Policyholders can switch options annually with 60-day notice and evidence of insurability if increasing coverage. Loans are available after one year up to 90% of surrender value at a 4% fixed rate, earning 3% in the fixed account, resulting in a net annual cost of 1%. Partial withdrawals start at $500, with initial free withdrawals followed by a $50 fee; they directly reduce the death benefit under Option 1. Outstanding loans also diminish the payout upon claim. Surrender charges apply during the first 12 years, decreasing progressively from 10% in Year 1 down to 7% in Year 4 and further reductions through Year 7 onward.","topics":["Death Benefits","Policy Loans","Withdrawals","Surrender Charges"],"facts":[{"name":"Level Death Benefit Fixed","sentence":"Death Benefit under Option 1 is set at $500,000.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Option 1","Death Benefit","Fixed Amount"],"entities":[{"name":"Level Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"current default option","relational_anchors":["Option 1"]},{"name":"$500,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"fixed death benefit amount","relational_anchors":["Death Benefit = $500,000"]},{"name":"Increasing Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"growing benefit tied to account value","relational_anchors":["Option 2"]},{"name":"Specified Amount","type":"CONCEPT","role":"base component of increasing death benefit","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Account Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"variable component added to specified amount","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"any anniversary","type":"DATE","role":"timing window for changing options","relational_anchors":["60 days notice"]},{"name":"Evidence of insurability","type":"CONCEPT","role":"requirement to increase coverage","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"POLICY LOANS","type":"CONCEPT","role":"borrowing feature available post-year one","relational_anchors":["after 1 year","Maximum: 90% of surrender value","Loan interest: 4%","Loaned amounts earn fixed account rate (3%)","Net cost: 1%"]},{"name":"90%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"maximum loan-to-surrender-value ratio","relational_anchors":["Maximum: 90% of surrender value"]},{"name":"4% annually","type":"RATE","role":"fixed annual loan interest rate","relational_anchors":["Loan interest: 4% annually"]},{"name":"3%","type":"RATE","role":"annual earnings rate on loaned funds","relational_anchors":["Loaned amounts earn fixed account rate (3%)"]},{"name":"1% annually","type":"RATE","role":"net annual cost of borrowing","relational_anchors":["Net cost: 1% annually"]},{"name":"PARTIAL WITHDRAWALS","type":"CONCEPT","role":"withdrawal mechanism reducing death benefit","relational_anchors":["Minimum: $500","Maximum: Account value minus surrender charge","First 10 withdrawals free; $50 fee thereafter","Reduces death benefit dollar-for-dollar under Option 1"]},{"name":"$500","type":"AMOUNT","role":"minimum withdrawal threshold","relational_anchors":["Minimum: $500"]},{"name":"$50 fee","type":"FEES","role":"charge per withdrawal beyond first ten","relational_anchors":["$50 fee thereafter"]},{"name":"Outstanding loans","type":"CONCEPT","role":"liabilities reducing final death benefit","relational_anchors":["reduce death benefit at time of claim"]},{"name":"Surrender Charges","type":"CHARGE","role":"penalties for early termination","relational_anchors":["Year 1: 10%","Year 4: 7%","Year 7:"]},{"name":"Year 1","type":"YEAR","role":"first year subject to highest surrender charge","relational_anchors":["Year 1: 10%"]},{"name":"Year 4","type":"YEAR","role":"fourth year with reduced surrender charge","relational_anchors":["Year 4: 7%"]}]},{"name":"Level Death Benefit","sentence":"Option 1 provides a level death benefit.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Death Benefit Options","Fixed Coverage","Policy Structure"],"entities":[{"name":"Level Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"current default option","relational_anchors":["Option 1"]},{"name":"$500,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"fixed death benefit amount","relational_anchors":["Death Benefit = $500,000"]},{"name":"Increasing Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"growing benefit tied to account value","relational_anchors":["Option 2"]},{"name":"Specified Amount","type":"CONCEPT","role":"base component of increasing death benefit","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Account Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"variable component added to specified amount","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"any anniversary","type":"DATE","role":"timing window for changing options","relational_anchors":["60 days notice"]},{"name":"Evidence of insurability","type":"CONCEPT","role":"requirement to increase coverage","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"POLICY LOANS","type":"CONCEPT","role":"borrowing feature available post-year one","relational_anchors":["after 1 year","Maximum: 90% of surrender value","Loan interest: 4%","Loaned amounts earn fixed account rate (3%)","Net cost: 1%"]},{"name":"90%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"maximum loan-to-surrender-value ratio","relational_anchors":["Maximum: 90% of surrender value"]},{"name":"4% annually","type":"RATE","role":"fixed annual loan interest rate","relational_anchors":["Loan interest: 4% annually"]},{"name":"3%","type":"RATE","role":"annual earnings rate on loaned funds","relational_anchors":["Loaned amounts earn fixed account rate (3%)"]},{"name":"1% annually","type":"RATE","role":"net annual cost of borrowing","relational_anchors":["Net cost: 1% annually"]},{"name":"PARTIAL WITHDRAWALS","type":"CONCEPT","role":"withdrawal mechanism reducing death benefit","relational_anchors":["Minimum: $500","Maximum: Account value minus surrender charge","First 10 withdrawals free; $50 fee thereafter","Reduces death benefit dollar-for-dollar under Option 1"]},{"name":"$500","type":"AMOUNT","role":"minimum withdrawal threshold","relational_anchors":["Minimum: $500"]},{"name":"$50 fee","type":"FEES","role":"charge per withdrawal beyond first ten","relational_anchors":["$50 fee thereafter"]},{"name":"Outstanding loans","type":"CONCEPT","role":"liabilities reducing final death benefit","relational_anchors":["reduce death benefit at time of claim"]},{"name":"Surrender Charges","type":"CHARGE","role":"penalties for early termination","relational_anchors":["Year 1: 10%","Year 4: 7%","