<node id="13af4faa-d9b6-470b-ae94-68c01a26e0f3">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Insurance Policy Terms &amp; Conditions","text":"0 days before lapse.\n\n10.2 Grace period: 61 days to pay sufficient premium to bring \n     policy back in force.\n\n10.3 If premium not received within grace period, policy lapses \n     and any remaining surrender value is paid to you.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 11 - EXCLUSIONS AND LIMITATIONS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n11.1 SUICIDE: If insured commits suicide within 2 years of issue \n     or reinstatement, we pay only premiums paid minus any \n     withdrawals and charges, without interest.\n\n11.2 CONTESTABILITY: We may contest this policy for material \n     misrepresentation for 2 years from issue date.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 12 - IMPORTANT DISCLOSURES\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n12.1 This is NOT a securities product. Index participation does \n     not involve direct ownership of stocks or index funds.\n\n12.2 Dividends from index components are NOT included in index \n     performance calculations.\n\n12.3 Cap rates, participation rates, and fixed account rates may \n     change annually but will never go below guaranteed minimums.\n\n12.4 Past index performance does not guarantee future results.\n\n12.5 Zero is your hero - you cannot lose money due to negative \n     index performance, but you also don't participate in \n     dividends.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nQuestions? Contact us:\nHorizon Wealth Protection Insurance\nPhone: 1-888-HORIZON-1\nWeb: www.horizonwealthprotection.com\n\nExecuted at Chicago, Illinois\n\n[SEAL]\n\n_________________________________\nChief Executive Officer\nHorizon Wealth Protection Insurance","summary":"This document details critical aspects of an insurance policy, including a 61-day grace period to reinstate coverage after missed payments, with forfeiture of surrender value if payment isn’t made. It specifies two major exclusions: no death benefit payout for suicide within two years of issuance or reinstatement, and a two-year contestability clause for material misrepresentations. Important disclosures clarify that the product is not a security, excludes dividends from index returns, ensures minimum guaranteed rates, and emphasizes past performance doesn’t predict future outcomes—while noting zero downside risk due to negative index movement.","topics":["Grace Period","Policy Exclusions","Index-Based Features","Risk Disclosures"],"facts":[{"name":"Policy Lapse Timing","sentence":"The policy lapses 0 days before lapse.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["policy lapse","grace period end","timing of termination"],"entities":[{"name":"0 days before lapse","type":"DATE","role":"timeframe prior to policy termination","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Grace period","type":"CONCEPT","role":"window to reinstate policy after missed payment","relational_anchors":["61 days"]},{"name":"Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"payment required to maintain coverage","relational_anchors":["sufficient premium"]},{"name":"Surrender value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"cash value returned upon policy lapse","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Suicide","type":"CONCEPT","role":"excluded event if occurs within 2 years","relational_anchors":["within 2 years of issue or reinstatement"]},{"name":"Contestability","type":"CONCEPT","role":"period during which policy can be challenged","relational_anchors":["for 2 years from issue date"]},{"name":"Index participation","type":"CONCEPT","role":"mechanism linking returns to market indices","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Dividends","type":"CONCEPT","role":"income excluded from index calculation","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cap rates","type":"CONCEPT","role":"maximum rate applied to index gains","relational_anchors":["may change annually"]},{"name":"Participation rates","type":"CONCEPT","role":"percentage of index gain credited","relational_anchors":["may change annually"]},{"name":"Fixed account rates","type":"CONCEPT","role":"interest rate offered on cash component","relational_anchors":["may change annually"]},{"name":"Guaranteed minimums","type":"CONCEPT","role":"floor protecting against rate drops","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Past index performance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"historical data used for illustration","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Zero is your hero","type":"CONCEPT","role":"risk protection feature limiting downside loss","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Horizon Wealth Protection Insurance","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuer of the life insurance policy","relational_anchors":["www.horizonwealthprotection.com","1-888-HORIZON-1"]},{"name":"Chicago, Illinois","type":"LOCATION","role":"place where agreement was executed","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Chief Executive Officer","type":"PERSON","role":"executive signing authority","relational_anchors":["Horizon Wealth Protection Insurance"]}]},{"name":"Grace Period Duration","sentence":"The grace period allows 61 days to pay sufficient premium to bring the policy back in force.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["grace period","policy reinstatement","premium payment window"],"entities":[{"name":"0 days before lapse","type":"DATE","role":"timeframe prior to policy termination","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Grace period","type":"CONCEPT","role":"window to reinstate policy after missed payment","relational_anchors":["61 days"]},{"name":"Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"payment required to maintain coverage","relational_anchors":["sufficient premium"]},{"name":"Surrender value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"cash value returned upon policy lapse","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Suicide","type":"CONCEPT","role":"excluded event if occurs within 2 years","relational_anchors":["within 2 years of issue or reinstatement"]},{"name":"Contestability","type":"CONCEPT","role":"period during which policy can be challenged","relational_anchors":["for 2 years from issue date"]},{"name":"Index participation","type":"CONCEPT","role":"mechanism linking returns to market indices","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Dividends","type":"CONCEPT","role":"income excluded from index calculation","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cap rates","type":"CONCEPT","role":"maximum rate applied to index gains","relational_anchors":["may change annually"]},{"name":"Participation rates","type":"CONCEPT","role":"percentage of index gain credited","relational_anchors":["may change annually"]},{"name":"Fixed account rates","type":"CONCEPT","role":"interest rate offered on cash component","relational_anchors":["may change annually"]},{"name":"Guaranteed minimums","type":"CONCEPT","role":"floor protecting against rate drops","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Past index performance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"historical data used for illustration","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Zero is your hero","type":"CONCEPT","role":"risk protection feature limiting downside loss","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Horizon Wealth Protection Insurance","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuer of the life insurance policy","relational_anchors":["www.horizonwealthprotection.com","1-888-HORIZON-1"]},{"name":"Chicago, Illinois","type":"LOCATION","role":"place where agreement was executed","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Chief Executive Officer","type":"PERSON","role":"executive signing authority","relational_anchors":["Horizon Wealth Protection Insurance"]}]},{"name":"Policy Lapse Due to Non-Payment","sentence":"If the premium is not received within the grace period, the policy lapses.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Grace Period","Premium Payment","Policy Lapse"],"entities":[{"name":"0 days before lapse","type":"DATE","role":"timeframe prior to policy termination","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Grace period","type":"CONCEPT","role":"window to reinstate policy after mi