<edge source="85d5d6ec-ad6b-42c0-aa96-0ffaa07ffc38" target="2ddf90e7-2886-4a5a-8ad0-c6e43a7d08bc">
  <data key="d3">The policy number uniquely identifies the insurance contract but does not provide any information about the insured’s gender.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="85d5d6ec-ad6b-42c0-aa96-0ffaa07ffc38" target="deefe5c8-640f-408f-a9d3-69fdb6670c3a">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 assigns a unique identifier to the policy described in fact_sentence_2, enabling precise tracking and referencing of the $500,000 face amount.</data>
  <data key="d4">IDENTIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="85d5d6ec-ad6b-42c0-aa96-0ffaa07ffc38" target="b2a30ea9-f6f0-4538-a482-ad994edbeb6b">
  <data key="d3">The policy number HWP-IUL-2024-7290 uniquely identifies the insurance contract associated with Jessica Lynn Thompson, who is the named insured.</data>
  <data key="d4">IDENTIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="85d5d6ec-ad6b-42c0-aa96-0ffaa07ffc38" target="50af0d4a-2680-43a9-9d6f-6eec2018a92a">
  <data key="d3">The policy number uniquely identifies the IUL policy, while the date of birth confirms the identity of the insured person, Jessica Lynn Thompson. Together, they help verify that the correct policy corresponds to the right individual.</data>
  <data key="d4">IDENTIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="85d5d6ec-ad6b-42c0-aa96-0ffaa07ffc38" target="28a24c34-9b68-4a03-8fa4-c916776a3831">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 identifies the policy using a unique number, which helps locate it administratively. Fact sentence 2 specifies when the policy was officially issued, providing temporal context.</data>
  <data key="d4">IDENTIFIED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="85d5d6ec-ad6b-42c0-aa96-0ffaa07ffc38" target="e399f893-720a-491e-9762-ced1c8d9eb29">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 assigns a unique identification number to the policy. This identifier links to the broader profile described in fact sentence 2, where the insured’s underwriting class is specified.</data>
  <data key="d4">IDENTIFIED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
