  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 defines Index Accounts tied to market performance, whereas fact_sentence_2 introduces Fixed Accounts with guaranteed returns, highlighting a contrasting mechanism. The two provide alternative structures for interest crediting without direct interdependence.</data>
