  <data key="d3">The first sentence introduces a type of investment account with guaranteed returns, while the second specifies a maximum gain limit on an index-linked account. These concepts operate under different financial structures and do not influence each other directly.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
