  <data key="d3">The Cap Rate governs potential returns in indexed accounts, whereas the Year 3 surrender charge affects early withdrawal costs. While both influence overall policy value, they operate independently—one impacts earnings, the other penalizes termination.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
