  <data key="d3">The Point-to-Point Method details the operational mechanics behind interest crediting in an Index Account, providing concrete implementation of the abstract concept introduced in the prior statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
