  <data key="d3">The Point-to-Point Method describes how index-linked accounts calculate gains over time; however, it has no bearing on the definition of a Fixed Account, which operates independently of market fluctuations.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
