  <data key="d3">The guaranteed 3% annual return on the Fixed Account provides a stable benchmark, ensuring investors receive at least that yield regardless of market conditions. This supports the broader framework where even under adverse scenarios, participants benefit from predictable outcomes, complemented by the 25% minimum participation rate in indexed accounts.</data>
