<edge source="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405" target="6ff1f4bc-a2b4-4e15-b514-415d803bd39b">
  <data key="d3">The Fixed Account’s guaranteed 3% return aligns with broader protections ensuring interest credits remain within defined bounds; however, unlike indexed accounts, this fixed rate itself isn't typically subject to external caps or participation rates—it remains stable regardless of market fluctuations.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
