<edge source="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405" target="5af4b2af-c88c-4ee5-ab6b-3214a72b0be8">
  <data key="d3">The Fixed Account offers a stable 3% annual return regardless of market conditions, providing predictable growth. This contrasts with the indexed accounts' behavior under market declines, where a 0% floor protects against losses, ensuring no negative credit despite falling indexes.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
