  <data key="d3">The guaranteed 3% return in the Fixed Account provides stable growth independent of market movements, contributing to the overall financial security of the product. This stability complements the 0% floor on indexed accounts, ensuring policyholders avoid losses even when markets fall.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
