  <data key="d3">The Fixed Account's guaranteed 3% return ensures stable growth independent of market performance, contrasting with the indexed accounts' exposure to market declines. The claim about earning zero interest only applies to indexed accounts under poor market conditions, not the Fixed Account.</data>
