<edge source="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405" target="ec56b365-0020-450d-9cc6-283a79189906">
  <data key="d3">The fixed account’s guaranteed 3.0% return contributes to overall account growth, potentially supporting future increases in account value, though it does not affect the Level Death Benefit of $500,000 under Option 1, which remains constant regardless of investment performance.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
