</edge>
<edge source="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405" target="e1d7d59c-ecc5-48bc-b7c4-1fd4fcfbe199">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed 3.0% return on the Fixed Account contributes to growing the account value over time, which supports the underlying assets used to fund the Level Death Benefit under Option 1. Higher account values may increase the likelihood of meeting minimum guarantee thresholds but do not alter the fixed nature of the Level Death Benefit itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDIRECTLY_SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405" target="024598e4-2394-4fad-b636-543f3ffb9225">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed 3.0% return in the Fixed Account ensures stable growth for funds allocated there, while partial withdrawals under Option 1 directly lower the death benefit, potentially impacting future payouts despite steady credited interest.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405" target="cdffaf84-8d6b-4f83-8142-43784e03289a">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed 3.0% return in the Fixed Account contributes to the policy’s cash value, which may be used as collateral for loans. These loans, when outstanding, reduce the death benefit, meaning the accumulated value from the Fixed Account could indirectly affect final payout amounts.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDIRECTLY_AFFECTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.55</data>
</edge>
<edge source="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405" target="6f98a9e1-688e-4680-b305-6c7ecf379647">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed 3.0% return on the Fixed Account provides stable growth, while policy loans becoming available after one year offer liquidity access. These elements together inform long-term investment strategy and cash flow planning within the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405" target="16db743e-8a3d-4763-8527-b5d06fd8aafb">
  <data key="d3">The Fixed Account's 3.0% guaranteed return exceeds the 1% net cost of policy loans, suggesting that utilizing borrowed funds may still yield positive net returns if invested in the Fixed Account.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405" target="84b477e8-9a8c-4a97-b7ac-12df058493f6">
  <data key="d3">The Fixed Account’s 3.0% yield is lower than the 4% loan interest rate, creating a net cost when borrowing against it. This suggests that taking a policy loan may erode the benefits of holding assets in the Fixed Account.</data>
  <data key="d4">ECONOMICALLY_DISADVANTAGEOUS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
