</edge>
<edge source="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a" target="e56d9b1f-113b-4961-abbd-159d8047aeca">
  <data key="d3">The absence of a cap on the Fixed Account means its returns are uncapped, unlike some indexed accounts. This characteristic does not influence or relate to the 100% participation rate in the Global Diversified Index Account.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a" target="f64306b3-60d7-48b6-82c2-6580397642e1">
  <data key="d3">The Fixed Account offers an uncapped return potential, allowing unlimited growth based on credited interest, unlike the indexed accounts which face return ceilings. This structural distinction highlights how risk and reward profiles differ across account types, independent of the indexing floor applied elsewhere.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a" target="7898028b-343b-4195-9f4c-a6280a62d640">
  <data key="d3">The absence of a cap in the Fixed Account means its returns are uncapped, unlike the indexed accounts which face capping. This feature contrasts with the crediting period of the Global Diversified Index Account, which governs frequency rather than limit magnitude.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a" target="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405">
  <data key="d3">Since the Fixed Account has no cap on returns, the guaranteed 3.0% annual interest becomes part of an uncapped growth opportunity, increasing investor benefit over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES</data>
