<edge source="d2272e16-5b5e-4cf0-8180-275ee09c4556" target="8886f5ce-b28a-43b5-85a1-63104105310a">
  <data key="d3">The first sentence describes a structural feature of the Fixed Account—that it lacks a downside protection floor. This detail is unrelated to the second sentence, which explains how interest is calculated in an indexed account based on a cap and participation rate.</data>
