<edge source="13737585-4de1-4789-b42c-a05bc511593e" target="27176921-2e5c-44aa-bcf0-40ddf6e140f2">
  <data key="d3">The current allocation to the NASDAQ-100 Index determines the weight of that index's performance in the overall investment mix, influencing total returns. Interest credited depends on the index’s percentage change and the participation rate, meaning higher allocations could amplify impact if the index performs well.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL_RELATION</data>
