  <data key="d3">The 30% allocation to the NASDAQ-100 Index establishes the portion of the portfolio eligible for indexing; given the contract's rules, any gain from this index is subject to a 10.5% cap and 100% participation rate.</data>
  <data key="d4">APPLIES_TO</data>
