  <data key="d3">The 20% allocation to the Fixed Account reflects investor positioning within the product’s diversified structure; however, since the Fixed Account lacks a floor, this allocation carries higher potential downside compared to the indexed accounts, despite being part of a broader safeguarded framework.</data>
