  <data key="d3">The current 20% allocation to the Fixed Account reflects an investor’s chosen balance among available accounts. This specific allocation could inform whether future reallocations are needed, especially given the availability of free adjustments up to four times annually.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL_RELATION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
