</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="e56d9b1f-113b-4961-abbd-159d8047aeca">
  <data key="d3">Policyholders’ ability to change investments annually allows them to shift funds into higher-performing accounts such as the Global Diversified Index Account, which offers a 100% participation rate, thereby potentially maximizing returns based on index performance.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXPOSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
