  <data key="d3">Investors have the right to modify their asset allocations at each policy anniversary. These adjustments do not affect the Fixed Account's guaranteed 3% annual yield.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
