  <data key="d3">Investors who can adjust allocations annually benefit from the Fixed Account’s lack of a cap, using it as a reliable anchor within shifting strategies without exposure to upside limits.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
