  <data key="d3">Policyholders’ right to modify allocations every policy anniversary enables dynamic portfolio management. This operational freedom exists regardless of whether the Fixed Account includes a floor, as such protections apply only to indexed accounts.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
