  <data key="d3">Investors can modify their asset allocations at policy anniversaries, enabling strategic adjustments based on financial goals. This flexibility coexists with the Fixed Account’s invariant interest rate, ensuring steady performance even when shifting funds across accounts.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
