  <data key="d3">Free reallocation rights allow investors to shift assets among accounts multiple times each year at no charge, regardless of the specific performance limits like the cap set on the Global Diversified Index Account.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
