  <data key="d3">Free reallocation rights allow investors to shift assets up to four times annually at no charge, regardless of whether they use the indexed or fixed accounts. This policy operates independently of the 0% floor applied to the indexed account.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
