  <data key="d3">Free reallocations allow investors to shift assets without penalty up to four times a year. While this flexibility supports strategic asset management, it operates independently of the Fixed Account’s guaranteed yield.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
