  <data key="d3">A minimum participation rate of 25% in indexed accounts ensures meaningful upside potential despite capping mechanisms, whereas the uncapped Fixed Account provides predictable growth unaffected by external limits. Both support long-term stability through distinct structural protections.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
