  <data key="d3">Participation rates in the indexed accounts are guaranteed to remain above 25%, providing downside protection even if markets underperform. Meanwhile, the Fixed Account offers a consistent 3% return unaffected by external factors.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0f6b3b49-d7b3-4758-a638-6cbce563fda7" target="b5a49b5f-16b1-4dba-94df-96a105e6000e">
  <data key="d3">A minimum participation rate of 25% ensures that investors receive at least some benefit from index growth, irrespective of the specific allocation mix. This rule governs how credited returns are computed across all indexed accounts, including those holding exposure to the S&amp;P 500.</data>
