  <data key="d3">A minimum participation rate of 25% applies to all index-based credits, including those tied to the NASDAQ-100. This means any allocation to such indices, like the stated 30%, will benefit from this floor, ensuring non-zero credited growth regardless of negative market movements.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL SUPPORT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
