  <data key="d3">The guarantee that participation rates won’t fall below 25% ensures consistent performance benefits from indexing, irrespective of whether allocation changes occur on a policy anniversary or otherwise.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
