  <data key="d3">Participation rates are maintained above 25%, meaning investors receive at least a quarter of the index's gain each period. This directly influences how much of the underlying index’s movement translates into credited interest, complementing the cap constraint.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
