  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 ensures that investors receive at least 25% of index gains, protecting against low credit allocations. This does not affect or relate to the fixed account’s guaranteed yield described in sentence 2.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
