  <data key="d3">The minimum 25% participation rate ensures that even when market performance is weak, the policyholder still receives meaningful credits, contributing to the overall protection from negative returns during market declines.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0f6b3b49-d7b3-4758-a638-6cbce563fda7" target="5af4b2af-c88c-4ee5-ab6b-3214a72b0be8">
  <data key="d3">The 25% minimum participation rate ensures meaningful upside capture if the index rises, while the 0% floor prevents any loss if the index falls by 5%. Together, they create a balanced incentive structure within the indexed accounts.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
