  <data key="d3">The minimum 25% participation rate ensures that even in low-return scenarios, investors receive some benefit from index growth. This baseline allows higher participation rates like 100% to fully leverage index performance within the cap limit.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_DEPENDENCY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
