  <data key="d3">The mandatory 25% participation rate ensures stable indexing performance, which indirectly supports long-term account growth that could benefit future withdrawals. However, it does not influence or constrain the 10% annual partial withdrawal allowance.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0f6b3b49-d7b3-4758-a638-6cbce563fda7" target="120104c2-987f-4f54-a944-5d235a6dd5df">
  <data key="d3">The minimum 25% participation rate ensures meaningful upside potential in indexed accounts, while surrender charges penalize early withdrawals. These features operate independently—one affects returns, the other exit costs—but together shape overall investor incentives over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
