  <data key="d3">The minimum 25% participation rate ensures stable growth potential in indexed accounts, while free partial withdrawals allow flexibility in accessing funds post-Year 1. These features serve distinct purposes—one enhances long-term performance assurance, the other supports short-to-medium term liquidity needs.</data>
