  <data key="d3">The minimum 25% participation rate on index credits ensures stable performance benefits regardless of market fluctuations, while policy loans becoming available after one year provide liquidity access later in the contract term. These elements serve distinct purposes—one related to investment crediting, the other to cash flow flexibility—and do not affect each other’s operation.</data>
