<edge source="c4dbdf51-a4cd-4a65-8903-f269d529eefd" target="f64306b3-60d7-48b6-82c2-6580397642e1">
  <data key="d3">The fixed account offers a guaranteed minimum yield of 2%, reflecting the product’s commitment to downside protection. Similarly, the Global Diversified Index Account includes a 0% floor, reinforcing consistent risk mitigation across both indexed and fixed components.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
