  <data key="d3">The fixed account’s guaranteed 2% yield supports long-term accumulation, indirectly contributing to higher account values over time, which may affect future death benefits under Option 2. However, it has no direct impact on the fixed $500,000 Level Death Benefit specified in fact_sentence_2.</data>
