  <data key="d3">While interest credited generally faces caps and floors, the Fixed Account operates under a distinct model: it delivers a guaranteed 3% yield unaffected by such limits, making its behavior different from indexed accounts despite sharing the same structural safeguards.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
