  <data key="d3">Even with high participation or favorable index growth, the credit is still bounded above by the cap; however, the presence of a floor ensures that declining indices cannot result in negative returns regardless of the cap's level.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
