  <data key="d3">The presence of a 0% floor ensures that investors do not lose money when the index falls, which directly supports the fairness and safety of the credit calculation system described in the case of rising indices like the S&amp;P 500’s 15% increase.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
