  <data key="d3">Protection from market declines through a 0% floor ensures policyholders maintain at least zero returns during downturns, reinforcing confidence in the product’s resilience. This safeguard works alongside the Fixed Account’s guaranteed 3% return to provide layered downside protection.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
