  <data key="d3">The guarantee of no principal loss during market declines ensures financial stability regardless of investment performance. This feature operates independently of when premiums are paid, allowing flexible contributions without affecting downside protection.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
