  <data key="d3">The ability to pay premiums at any time does not affect the fixed $12 monthly administrative charge, which is consistently applied regardless of when payments occur.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="50dee1d7-a696-448d-92e6-11dfe14d068f" target="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08">
  <data key="d3">The ability to pay premiums at any time allows policyholders to make contributions before the monthly deduction date, potentially influencing how much is left in the account after charges are taken.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
