  <data key="d3">The ability to pay premiums at any time ensures policyholders maintain control over funding schedules, which supports sustained eligibility for benefits under fixed COI rates that remain unchanged per the policy’s guarantee.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
