  <data key="d3">Premiums may be paid at any time without restriction, offering convenience and adaptability in funding the policy. This flexibility does not influence the 0% floor protection, which remains active irrespective of payment timing.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86b72d75-5a59-44c2-b2d6-912ce393cf76" target="116850af-15ce-4679-bcc4-58d5753875d7">
  <data key="d3">Flexible premium payment timing allows contributors to adjust deposits without constraints, enabling them to maintain coverage under any schedule. This freedom complements the policy’s built-in floor mechanism, which prevents losses due to market volatility.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES STABILITY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86b72d75-5a59-44c2-b2d6-912ce393cf76" target="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7">
  <data key="d3">Flexible premium payment timing enables contributors to adjust schedules based on personal finances. This freedom exists separately from the policy’s built-in protection against market losses, which remains active irrespective of payment timing.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86b72d75-5a59-44c2-b2d6-912ce393cf76" target="a53ff70e-2b10-4259-9e14-fe7adb0931b1">
  <data key="d3">The lack of restrictions on when premiums can be paid provides scheduling freedom for contributors, regardless of whether they expect zero returns or other performance outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
