  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 clarifies that there is no limitation on the timing of premium payments, reinforcing the claim made in fact sentence 1 that such payments can be made at any time.</data>
  <data key="d4">REINFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
