  <data key="d3">The absence of time restrictions on premium payments allows policyholders to pay whenever convenient, as long as each payment meets the minimum threshold of $100.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86b72d75-5a59-44c2-b2d6-912ce393cf76" target="44171d39-27ff-4fcc-bf40-58a3e92080fa">
  <data key="d3">The absence of timing restrictions allows policyholders to pay premiums at any point, enabling them to meet the mandatory minimum of $100 whenever convenient.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
