  <data key="d3">The absence of timing restrictions allows policyholders to defer payments, enabling them to skip contributions if their account balance remains adequate to absorb monthly charges without lapsing.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
