  <data key="d3">The absence of restrictions on premium payment timing does not influence the monthly deduction of Cost of Insurance (COI). These are independent operational features of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
