  <data key="d3">The absence of restrictions on premium payment timing does not affect how monthly charges are calculated or composed. The information about flexible payment schedules stands independently from the breakdown of recurring fees.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
