  <data key="d3">The ability to pay premiums at any time does not affect the fixed monthly charge deduction occurring on the third day of every month. These are independent operational rules governing different aspects of the policy’s financial mechanics.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
