  <data key="d3">The existence of a $50,000 annual premium cap due to tax qualifications has no bearing on whether payments can be made at any time. Payment timing freedom is independent of statutory limits.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
