  <data key="d3">The $50,000 annual premium cap ensures compliance with IRS tax rules, setting a legal upper bound on contributions. This cap influences long-term funding strategy, potentially affecting how frequently or consistently the monthly COI charges are covered from the account balance.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFLUENCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
