  <data key="d3">The $50,000 annual premium cap ensures compliance with IRS rules, which helps maintain the policy’s tax-qualified status. This cap influences the maximum amount that can be invested into the account, thereby affecting the account value used in the COI calculation.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDIRECTLY_INFLUENCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
