  <data key="d3">The $50,000 annual premium cap ensures alignment with IRS tax rules, which indirectly supports sustainable funding mechanisms that may influence how ongoing charges like COI and admin fees are managed over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL_RELATION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.25</data>
</edge>
