  <data key="d3">The $50,000 annual premium cap affects the amount subject to surrender charges, meaning larger contributions under this cap increase potential future surrender fees, particularly relevant in Year 3 when the charge is 8%.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
