  <data key="d3">The assumption that current actuarial and financial models hold true directly informs the assessment of what constitutes a worst-case outcome like 0% interest.</data>
  <data key="d4">UNDERLIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2bf05a03-d336-46dd-a382-121bb038f1a6" target="50dee1d7-a696-448d-92e6-11dfe14d068f">
  <data key="d3">Recommendations such as contributing $6,000 annually assume ongoing favorable actuarial and financial conditions; without them, timely premium payments may not suffice to maintain coverage despite their flexibility.</data>
