  <data key="d3">The assumption behind the $6,000 recommendation relies on current actuarial models, meaning its sustainability hinges on meeting the minimum $100 premium requirement to maintain policy integrity.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
