  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 indicates that the suggested $6,000 contribution relies on existing assumptions, which contextualizes the significance of the $50,000 annual ceiling mentioned in fact_sentence_1—suggesting such caps could also be assumption-dependent.</data>
