<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="99a2ea02-45ff-4204-9c3f-be85350484db">
  <data key="d3">A flat monthly administrative fee of $12 is deducted from the account balance regardless of market conditions. This fee does not affect the floor protection that prevents losses beyond a 5% drop in the index.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="7d57accf-750c-4143-addd-8dbbeb124299">
  <data key="d3">A monthly administrative charge of $12 is subtracted from the account value regardless of performance. This fee operates separately from the policy’s floor protection mechanism, which safeguards against losses when the underlying index falls.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="116850af-15ce-4679-bcc4-58d5753875d7">
  <data key="d3">A flat $12 monthly administrative fee is deducted from the account value every month. This deduction occurs separately from any interest credits tied to index performance, such as the 0% credit during a 5% decline.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative fee is a standard deduction from the account value, independent of any market movements. It has no bearing on whether principal is protected during market downturns.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="a53ff70e-2b10-4259-9e14-fe7adb0931b1">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account value every month, contributing to lower effective gains. However, it does not affect whether the policy earns 0% interest—the absence of interest stems from external factors like poor index performance.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="50dee1d7-a696-448d-92e6-11dfe14d068f">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge exists independently of when premiums are paid, meaning it is unaffected by the flexible timing allowed for contributions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="86b72d75-5a59-44c2-b2d6-912ce393cf76">
  <data key="d3">The presence of a $12 monthly administrative charge has no bearing on the absence of time restrictions for paying premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="7d3930c1-6b23-4a04-93b3-d874c9e7b176">
  <data key="d3">A fixed monthly administrative fee of $12 is subtracted from the account value, independent of whether the premium meets the $100 minimum threshold.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="44171d39-27ff-4fcc-bf40-58a3e92080fa">
  <data key="d3">A flat $12 monthly administrative fee is charged irrespective of the premium amount. This fee remains consistent whether the premium is at the minimum ($100) or higher.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="b8046f06-ce88-4546-bb7c-16ba4c69bcf2">
  <data key="d3">A recurring monthly administrative charge of $12 is applied regardless of premium amount. This fee operates independently of the $50,000 annual premium cap.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="0d35c1ce-d96d-4562-80f8-0654abe126d2">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge is a recurring deduction unrelated to the $50,000 annual premium cap set for tax purposes.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="c0561218-4570-4bd7-925f-25cc01fd0c6d">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account value, potentially affecting whether the recommended $6,000 annual premium maintains sufficient funding over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="2bf05a03-d336-46dd-a382-121bb038f1a6">
  <data key="d3">A $12 monthly administrative charge reflects ongoing operational costs, unrelated to the actuarial assumptions that underpin recommendations for premium levels. The charge exists regardless of those assumptions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="a6609e69-c5f5-4d6e-9fa1-fc83061e83ae">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge contributes to the total deduction from the account value; therefore, it determines whether the remaining balance can support skipped premium payments under the policy’s flexible terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_CONDITION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="45f97aed-091e-480b-b637-f618f4e2486e">
  <data key="d3">To skip premium payments without lapsing coverage, the account must retain enough value to pay ongoing costs—including the $12 monthly administrative charge.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="0d7fabe2-d74d-4b84-a620-42c9acb1c43d">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 states that a flat $12 administrative fee is charged monthly, independent of premium amounts. It has no connection to the 3.5% load applied to premium payments described in fact sentence 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="6c580dbf-ec5e-4009-845b-7efb65de3c5a">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge is covered by the 3.5% premium load applied to each payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">INCLUDED_IN</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.9</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="e4d325d0-3102-4ecf-b8a5-e488e84fa28f">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge occurs simultaneously with the deduction of the Cost of Insurance (COI), forming part of the total monthly expenses on the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">SIMULTANEOUSLY_DEDUCTED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="9639c325-d6a7-4181-a801-0a4fdfaefa94">
  <data key="d3">A flat $12 monthly administrative fee is applied irrespective of changes in the account value or death benefit, unlike the cost-of-insurance deduction that fluctuates based on those variables.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c">
  <data key="d3">The administrative charge of $12 per month is a component of the total monthly charges, which also includes the cost-of-insurance fee.</data>
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="749f8b25-e9c6-4e2e-a60a-5fdcef1215c4">
  <data key="d3">A fixed $12 monthly administrative fee exists alongside the variable cost-of-insurance charge, which is determined by a formula dependent on the policy’s current values.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge is part of the total deductions made from the account value on the third day of every month.</data>
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge is a separate recurring fee unrelated to the guarantee on COI rates. It does not impact or reflect changes in the cost-of-insurance pricing.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="4392497f-15c1-48ee-8067-43a8245bc89e">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge contributes to total policy costs, which may influence whether a policyholder chooses to surrender the policy before the end of the 12-year surrender window due to accumulated fees.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="01ec375d-e72b-4c13-96a2-da5a23238018">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge contributes to the total cost burden that could impact the account value subject to surrender charges. Higher cumulative fees may reduce net cash surrender value when exiting early.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="5935cab6-342e-4e3e-9ea8-dbff499af332">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account value consistently, potentially impacting the amount available when calculating surrender charges like the 7% fee in Year 4.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="9dcea0cf-204b-429a-93cc-c257133b7890">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge contributes to the total cost burden on the policyholder, which may influence decisions about surrendering the policy before maturity. In Year 2, when a 9% surrender charge applies, these cumulative fees could affect whether surrendering becomes financially disadvantageous.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="00111295-2bb8-4547-912d-c65ce0d8d633">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account value over time, potentially affecting the amount available before surrender charges are applied in Year 5.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENTLY_RELEVANT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="273e0e6e-5536-4336-a312-2596a9f16c8b">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account value consistently, potentially impacting the amount available before surrender charges are applied in Year 3.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="84b84dec-45b7-4ca8-ae2f-a68466866f24">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account value over time, potentially affecting the amount available before surrender charges are applied in Year 6.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="29e19c25-f1c1-4c3e-8db6-46bce82c0dca">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge contributes to the total cost burden that may influence decisions about policy surrender, particularly in later years like Year 7 when surrender charges still apply.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="e9e8f00a-1414-40a5-99b4-1975b3ddee75">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge impacts the account value over time, potentially affecting the total funds available when calculating surrender charges like the 3% fee in Year 8.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="a3cf559b-392a-434d-8391-67212bc086c3">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge contributes to ongoing policy costs, distinct from the Year 10 surrender charge, which affects exit strategy decisions. Both represent financial obligations but operate under different conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.25</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="b29caae3-f13a-4b43-af52-606c74d4bb86">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge contributes to the total cost burden that could affect the account value used to calculate surrender charges in later years like Year 11.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="fe831b43-8690-4c01-9873-79e0ef24ae00">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account value consistently throughout the policy term, potentially affecting the amount subject to surrender charges in later years like Year 9.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="120104c2-987f-4f54-a944-5d235a6dd5df">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account value consistently, potentially influencing the total funds available when calculating surrender charges that depend on accumulated premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENTLY_AFFECTED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="8581e6b9-7fac-4b65-a5c3-f8bf614bbe73">
  <data key="d3">The administrative charge of $12/month persists throughout the policy term, including past Year 12 when surrender charges vanish, meaning ongoing fees remain regardless of withdrawal timing. This highlights sustained cost exposure beyond the point where early termination penalties end.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.25</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="8e4cefcc-7f56-4cf2-9f4b-3e5dc497847a">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account value over time, potentially lowering the cash surrender value when combined with surrender charges and loans. This operational detail influences the financial foundation used in calculating surrender outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDIRECTLY_AFFECTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="6f98a9e1-688e-4680-b305-6c7ecf379647">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account value over time, gradually building the cash value that eventually enables policy loans after one year of activity.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDIRECTLY_AFFECTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="e35519d3-d4b6-4a91-b9cc-794ecf0231f5">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account value over time, potentially lowering the surrender value, which in turn impacts the maximum allowable policy loan set at 90% of that value.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="84b477e8-9a8c-4a97-b7ac-12df058493f6">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge impacts the account balance used to fund policy-related activities like loans, indirectly affecting the effective cost of borrowing. Meanwhile, the 4% loan interest rate reflects a key feature influencing when borrowers might choose to access funds.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_COST_FACTOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="d39b66e7-d38a-450c-a287-bd1bf0a73d22">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account value, which may limit the maximum loanable amount based on surrender value. This indirect effect influences the pool of funds available for loans, though it does not alter the interest earned on those loans.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDIRECTLY_AFFECTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="cdffaf84-8d6b-4f83-8142-43784e03289a">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account value, potentially limiting funds available for policy loans, thereby influencing the extent to which loans may erode the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDIRECTLY_AFFECTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.55</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="16db743e-8a3d-4763-8527-b5d06fd8aafb">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge contributes to the total cost burden of holding the policy, indirectly affecting the affordability of taking out loans, though it does not influence the net borrowing cost calculation itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.25</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="6c81117f-d67b-45c8-b7c8-8a2a822df46d">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge reduces the account balance over time, which could affect the amount available for partial withdrawals. Although early withdrawals are free, ongoing fees like the administrative charge gradually erode funds used for such transactions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDIRECTLY_AFFECTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="f75970d5-49e2-416e-98bf-26056a65e3f9">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge gradually reduces the account value, which may affect the ability to make frequent or low-value partial withdrawals, though it doesn't set the $500 minimum requirement itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDIRECTLY_AFFECTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79" target="7aff69d9-e95c-4762-9fc3-9b84d35f05e5">
  <data key="d3">The $12 monthly administrative charge is unrelated to the $50 fee on later partial withdrawals, which occur only after ten such transactions. While both are fees imposed by the policy, they serve different purposes and are triggered independently.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="952db39e-d998-4617-adb2-5556d0f54f02" target="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has_monthly_fee</data>
</edge>
