<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="99a2ea02-45ff-4204-9c3f-be85350484db">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charge deductions happen regardless of market performance, meaning even under protected conditions, fees still reduce the account balance.</data>
