  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="a6609e69-c5f5-4d6e-9fa1-fc83061e83ae">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges, including cost-of-insurance and administrative fees, are deducted from the account value on the third day of each month. This deduction schedule allows holders to avoid premium payments as long as funds remain adequate after the charge.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="45f97aed-091e-480b-b637-f618f4e2486e">
  <data key="d3">The deduction of total charges on the third day of each month creates a fixed deadline for ensuring the account has enough funds to avoid negative impacts on coverage, especially relevant when considering whether to skip premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">TIMING_CONDITION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
