  <data key="d3">Since total charges, including COI, are deducted from the account value every month, the amount of COI itself is determined by the disparity between the death benefit and current account value.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFORMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
