  <data key="d3">Monthly charges reduce the account value regularly, affecting the funds available when considering surrender charges later. The 9% surrender charge in Year 2 depends on accumulated premiums and current account value, which may already reflect prior monthly deductions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENTLY_AFFECTS</data>
