  <data key="d3">Monthly charges reduce the account value regularly, affecting long-term accumulation, while the Year 3 surrender charge impacts the amount received if the policy is terminated at that stage. Both affect liquidity and final payout potential.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
