  <data key="d3">The loan terms described in fact_sentence_1 are part of a product offered by Horizon Wealth Protection Insurance, whose authority and legitimacy are confirmed in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL_SUPPORT</data>
