  <data key="d3">The minimum partial withdrawal amount of $500 pertains to policyholder access to funds, while the document's execution in Chicago, Illinois, relates to jurisdictional and administrative context. These elements exist independently within the document’s framework.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
