  <data key="d3">The absence of fees on the first ten partial withdrawals reflects a flexible access rule for cash accumulation. This provision does not affect or rely on whether the death benefit remains level under Option 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
