  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 outlines a fee-free period for partial withdrawals, independent of the charge differences between death benefit options discussed in fact_sentence_1. The information does not rely on nor affect the comparison of option-specific fees.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6c81117f-d67b-45c8-b7c8-8a2a822df46d" target="3d7d5200-92e7-4186-968d-e19ab1fbc8b6">
  <data key="d3">Free partial withdrawals (up to ten) have no impact on the calculation or increase of the death benefit under Option 2, even though such benefits grow with account value.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6c81117f-d67b-45c8-b7c8-8a2a822df46d" target="9dd93a2e-b1e4-427c-b771-0da3121d9f76">
  <data key="d3">Free partial withdrawals for the first ten transactions provide liquidity without additional costs, independent of whether a policyholder chooses to change their death benefit option annually.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6c81117f-d67b-45c8-b7c8-8a2a822df46d" target="52cae3fa-7111-45dd-93a0-0249fc2b3e25">
  <data key="d3">Free partial withdrawals for the first ten instances occur regardless of whether advance notice was given for changing death benefit options. The rules governing withdrawals are separate from those regulating option switches.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6c81117f-d67b-45c8-b7c8-8a2a822df46d" target="3493040d-88ba-470b-9604-c6e5ce8f6501">
  <data key="d3">Free partial withdrawals for the first ten instances do not affect the requirement for evidence of insurability when upgrading coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6c81117f-d67b-45c8-b7c8-8a2a822df46d" target="6f98a9e1-688e-4680-b305-6c7ecf379647">
  <data key="d3">Initial partial withdrawals are free for the first ten instances, independent of when policy loans become accessible after one year.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6c81117f-d67b-45c8-b7c8-8a2a822df46d" target="e35519d3-d4b6-4a91-b9cc-794ecf0231f5">
  <data key="d3">Free partial withdrawals, limited to the first ten, have no bearing on the cap for policy loans, which depends solely on surrender value.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
