  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 outlines terms regarding fee-free partial withdrawals under a specific insurance policy. Fact_sentence_2 gives the customer support contact number for the issuing insurer. There is no interaction between these two pieces of information beyond shared contextual origin.</data>
