  <data key="d3">The statement about free partial withdrawals pertains to policyholder benefits and transaction costs, while the mention of Chicago, Illinois, indicates the document’s place of execution. These elements serve different purposes—one operational, one procedural—and do not affect each other's meaning.</data>
