<edge source="7aff69d9-e95c-4762-9fc3-9b84d35f05e5" target="ec56b365-0020-450d-9cc6-283a79189906">
  <data key="d3">A $50 fee applies to each partial withdrawal made after the tenth year, which may indirectly impact the overall value of the policy, though it does not alter the initially specified $500,000 death benefit under Option 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
