  <data key="d3">The fee for additional partial withdrawals is governed by policy terms unrelated to the signatory’s position. No interaction exists between administrative roles and withdrawal costs.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7aff69d9-e95c-4762-9fc3-9b84d35f05e5" target="7c78ce63-cb1f-4b61-bdcd-88d0ce4bcb53">
  <data key="d3">The fee structure on partial withdrawals is unrelated to where the document was executed. One describes a financial condition tied to policy usage, while the other specifies geographical origin without influencing any policy term.</data>
