</edge>
<edge source="7aff69d9-e95c-4762-9fc3-9b84d35f05e5" target="e9cf97a9-cf24-4d3c-adf8-586c6935d0e1">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 describes a specific fee rule tied to policyholder actions, which applies within the framework established by Horizon Wealth Protection Insurance—the entity identified in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL_SOURCE</data>
