  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 outlines a specific fee associated with partial withdrawals, consistent with the broader policy rules detailed in chunk_summary_1. Fact_sentence_2 establishes when the document containing these rules was created, providing temporal context without altering the operational logic of the fee.</data>
