  <data key="d3">Outstanding policy loans reduce the death benefit, a feature explained in detail within the document whose effective date is specified here. This factual statement remains consistent regardless of when the document was created.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
