  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 adds essential legal and exclusionary boundaries—such as suicide clauses and contestability—that define when benefits may be denied despite premium compliance, thereby contextualizing the consequences beyond mere lapses or surrender fees.</data>
  <data key="d4">ELABORATES_ON</data>
  <data key="d5">0.87</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
