  <data key="d3">A 7% surrender charge in Year 4 may discourage early access to gains generated under the 100% participation rate in the S&amp;P 500 account, creating a financial disincentive that aligns with long-term holding incentives.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
