  <data key="d3">The Year 4 surrender charge impacts the net benefit realized when accessing funds, particularly relevant given the annual crediting cycle of the NASDAQ-100 account, where gains accumulate incrementally over periods defined by the 1-year credit term.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
