  <data key="d3">The Year 4 surrender charge impacts the liquidity and cost-effectiveness of exiting the policy, regardless of whether the Global Diversified Index Account was selected, meaning its presence doesn’t alter the availability or function of that specific index option.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
