  <data key="d3">The 7% surrender charge in Year 4 affects the cash surrender value calculation, potentially reducing returns if the policy is terminated early. Meanwhile, the 1% net loan cost impacts borrowers who use policy loans, influencing whether such actions are financially viable over time.</data>
