  <data key="d3">A 6% surrender charge in Year 5 indicates potential costs associated with exiting the policy early, whereas the 0% floor on the NASDAQ-100 Index Account guarantees minimum return protection. Together, they reflect design trade-offs between downside protection and access flexibility.</data>
