  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 indicates the surrender charge in Year 6 is 5%, reflecting a later stage in the gradual decline. This follows logically from fact sentence 1, which establishes a higher charge in Year 2 at 9%, showing a downward trajectory across the timeline.</data>
