  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states the surrender charge in Year 6 is 5%, which aligns with the declining pattern described in the chunk summary. Fact sentence 2 continues this trend by specifying a lower charge of 0.5% in Year 11, demonstrating the gradual reduction over time.</data>
