  <data key="d3">The surrender charge in Year 6 is 5%, reflecting the declining schedule over the initial 12-year period. This detail is unrelated to the No Lapse Guarantee Rider, which was not selected and thus has no operational effect on current policy conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">NOT APPLICABLE</data>
