  <data key="d3">The 4% surrender charge in Year 7 reflects the declining penalty schedule over time, consistent with the broader policy terms. Although unrelated to the 3% fixed account yield on loans, this charge could impact long-term planning around withdrawals or surrenders when considering existing debt obligations.</data>
