  <data key="d3">The surrender charge rate in Year 9 is a financial term tied to policyholder benefits and costs, while the document’s execution location in Chicago is administrative and jurisdictional. These details operate independently without mutual impact.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
