  <data key="d3">A 1% surrender charge in Year 10 implies that earlier years had higher charges, such as 4% in Year 7, consistent with the scheduled decrease over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">FOLLOWS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
