  <data key="d3">A surrender charge of 0.5% in Year 11 reflects ongoing administrative fees for exiting the policy near its maturity, distinct from the S&amp;P 500's 0% floor, which guarantees minimum returns regardless of market conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
