<edge source="b29caae3-f13a-4b43-af52-606c74d4bb86" target="32909f74-b806-4169-8ab1-602ea158ef9f">
  <data key="d3">A minimal surrender charge in Year 11 aligns with the design of the NASDAQ-100's 100% participation rate, implying that the product encourages holding through full term without penalizing later exits despite favorable returns.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b29caae3-f13a-4b43-af52-606c74d4bb86" target="bce094ed-5c85-40d1-800b-e0894835715b">
  <data key="d3">The Year 11 surrender charge of 0.5% applies regardless of index performance, including when the NASDAQ-100 has a zero-floor safeguard. This indicates that penalty structures do not override or depend on index-specific rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
