  <data key="d3">A surrender charge of 0.5% in Year 11 impacts the net amount received upon withdrawal, regardless of the 8.5% cap on index-based returns. This fee does not alter the cap itself but may affect whether policyholders choose to withdraw before maturity despite capped upside.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
