  <data key="d3">A consistent net borrowing cost of 1% per annum implies predictable financing costs, making it more financially viable to retain the policy into later years like Year 11, where surrender charges have significantly declined to 0.5%.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES_FEASIBILITY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
