<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="4392497f-15c1-48ee-8067-43a8245bc89e">
  <data key="d3">Annual partial withdrawals allow policyholders to take out up to 10% of the account value tax-free after the first year. This benefit operates independently of surrender charge rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="01ec375d-e72b-4c13-96a2-da5a23238018">
  <data key="d3">Free partial withdrawals allow policyholders to access funds annually without paying surrender charges, regardless of the current surrender fee level, such as the 10% charge in Year 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="9dcea0cf-204b-429a-93cc-c257133b7890">
  <data key="d3">Annual partial withdrawals up to 10% of the account value are permitted tax-free after the first year, regardless of whether surrender charges apply. These withdrawals do not influence the calculation or amount of surrender fees.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="273e0e6e-5536-4336-a312-2596a9f16c8b">
  <data key="d3">Annual partial withdrawals up to 10% of the account value are permitted tax-free after the first year. These withdrawals do not influence the calculation or amount of surrender charges assessed at any point during the policy term.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="5935cab6-342e-4e3e-9ea8-dbff499af332">
  <data key="d3">Tax-free partial withdrawals up to 10% of the account value each year do not influence the calculation or amount of surrender charges assessed if the policy is terminated early.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="00111295-2bb8-4547-912d-c65ce0d8d633">
  <data key="d3">Annual partial withdrawals of up to 10% of the account value are permitted without penalty, regardless of the current surrender charge level. This feature operates independently of the surrender charge schedule applied in Year 5.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="84b84dec-45b7-4ca8-ae2f-a68466866f24">
  <data key="d3">The availability of annual partial withdrawals does not affect the calculation or amount of surrender charges, which remain tied to premium payments and time elapsed since issuance.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="29e19c25-f1c1-4c3e-8db6-46bce82c0dca">
  <data key="d3">Annual partial withdrawals of up to 10% of the account value are permitted without penalty, regardless of the current surrender charge rate. Thus, even if the surrender charge is high in Year 7, such withdrawals remain allowed under the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="e9e8f00a-1414-40a5-99b4-1975b3ddee75">
  <data key="d3">The right to make a tax-free partial withdrawal of up to 10% of the account value annually exists independently of the surrender charge structure. Even though such withdrawals may reduce the account value, they do not alter the fixed 3% surrender charge applicable in Year 8 if the policy were surrendered at that time.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="fe831b43-8690-4c01-9873-79e0ef24ae00">
  <data key="d3">The right to withdraw up to 10% of the account value each year freely supports liquidity needs, regardless of whether surrender charges apply at any given time.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="a3cf559b-392a-434d-8391-67212bc086c3">
  <data key="d3">Annual partial withdrawals up to 10% of the account value are allowed without tax consequences. This feature operates independently of the surrender charge schedule, including its level in Year 10.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="b29caae3-f13a-4b43-af52-606c74d4bb86">
  <data key="d3">An annual 10% partial withdrawal privilege exists regardless of surrender charges. Even though the surrender charge in Year 11 is only 0.5%, it doesn’t influence eligibility or limits for such withdrawals.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="8581e6b9-7fac-4b65-a5c3-f8bf614bbe73">
  <data key="d3">Annual partial withdrawals up to 10% of the account value are allowed without tax consequences. These withdrawals occur irrespective of whether surrender charges still apply, including in Years 1 through 12 when such fees exist.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="120104c2-987f-4f54-a944-5d235a6dd5df">
  <data key="d3">Annual partial withdrawals allow policyholders to access up to 10% of the account value without penalty, independent of how surrender charges are calculated based on earlier premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="8e4cefcc-7f56-4cf2-9f4b-3e5dc497847a">
  <data key="d3">Annual partial withdrawals of up to 10% of the account value depend on the availability of cash surrender value, which itself is derived by reducing the account value by surrender charges and outstanding loans.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="628900ad-3981-4384-be18-2669a41ba276">
  <data key="d3">The ability to make annual partial withdrawals does not influence the availability of the no-lapse guarantee rider. These are separate policy provisions operating independently.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="7011576a-0546-4f50-af7e-9f414262d88b">
  <data key="d3">The availability of free partial withdrawals—limited to 10% of the account value per year—is contingent upon the policy being past its first year, ensuring early financial flexibility without penalty.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="c9695180-7458-48f9-8686-914a2e999aa0">
  <data key="d3">Partial withdrawals allow access to funds without affecting policy status, whereas the No Lapse Guarantee Rider ensures continued coverage regardless of account value decline. These mechanisms serve different purposes within the policy framework.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="59735a62-be54-4b86-a006-cd569871d4ef">
  <data key="d3">The ability to make annual partial withdrawals does not affect the status of the No Lapse Guarantee Rider, nor is it contingent upon its activation.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc">
  <data key="d3">The ability to make annual partial withdrawals does not affect the requirement to maintain premiums or influence the grace period outcome.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="12268e1c-c5d6-4433-beca-c792fd3b6311">
  <data key="d3">The ability to make annual partial withdrawals does not influence or relate to the duration of the grace period for premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="d4b10129-f843-43a5-8362-ff505e1fb13b">
  <data key="d3">The ability to make annual partial withdrawals up to 10% of the account value does not affect the decision to opt out of the No Lapse Guarantee Rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="f693b3ab-ce04-4645-b10b-f2a647d0f872">
  <data key="d3">The ability to make annual partial withdrawals may reduce the account value over time, potentially contributing to insufficiency for future premium payments. However, this does not directly cause or precede notification about impending lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="fed316a6-229f-46af-91a9-72511967565a">
  <data key="d3">The right to make annual partial withdrawals may impact the policy's financial health, potentially increasing the risk of lapse due to reduced account value, thereby leading to forfeiture of any remaining surrender value upon lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDIRECTLY RELATED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="1b43685f-2a0d-488f-9258-b0a8a87ea9f1">
  <data key="d3">Annual partial withdrawals up to 10% provide liquidity without affecting the underlying crediting structure, which maintains a 4% minimum cap regardless of withdrawal activity.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="0f6b3b49-d7b3-4758-a638-6cbce563fda7">
  <data key="d3">The ability to withdraw up to 10% annually has no impact on the minimum 25% participation rate used in index crediting, as these mechanisms serve distinct purposes within the contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="c4dbdf51-a4cd-4a65-8903-f269d529eefd">
  <data key="d3">Annual partial withdrawals of up to 10% do not affect the fixed account’s guaranteed 2% interest rate, which remains intact regardless of withdrawal activity.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENTLY_RELEVANT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.25</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="52cae3fa-7111-45dd-93a0-0249fc2b3e25">
  <data key="d3">Annual partial withdrawals up to 10% of account value provide liquidity that could influence decisions about changing death benefit options, though such changes still require formal 60-day notification regardless of withdrawal activity.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.25</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="e35519d3-d4b6-4a91-b9cc-794ecf0231f5">
  <data key="d3">Partial withdrawals are restricted to 10% of account value yearly, which does not affect the 90% loan cap based on surrender value. This ensures that withdrawal limits do not interfere with loan eligibility or vice versa.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="84b477e8-9a8c-4a97-b7ac-12df058493f6">
  <data key="d3">Partial withdrawals permit up to 10% of the account value per year tax-free, offering flexible fund access without accruing debt. This complements the loan feature, which has a fixed 4% interest rate, allowing users to choose lower-cost alternatives when possible.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="d39b66e7-d38a-450c-a287-bd1bf0a73d22">
  <data key="d3">Free partial withdrawals permit up to 10% of the account value annually without penalty, which complements the ability to borrow against the account’s value, though loans incur an effective cost due to the difference between the 4% loan rate and 3% earnings.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="16db743e-8a3d-4763-8527-b5d06fd8aafb">
  <data key="d3">Free partial withdrawals allow policyholders to access up to 10% of the account value annually without penalty, providing flexibility distinct from taking out loans. In contrast, borrowing incurs a net annual cost of 1%, making it more expensive than withdrawing freely.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="cdffaf84-8d6b-4f83-8142-43784e03289a">
  <data key="d3">Free partial withdrawals reduce the account value, thereby indirectly affecting the death benefit, similar to how outstanding loans erode the payout. While distinct mechanisms, both contribute to lowering the ultimate death benefit when claims are made.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="7c78ce63-cb1f-4b61-bdcd-88d0ce4bcb53">
  <data key="d3">The annual partial withdrawal rule described in fact_sentence_1 relates to policy benefits, while fact_sentence_2 identifies the geographical origin of the document—these elements operate independently without mutual dependency.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="9ac0c7c4-1321-469b-afaa-abe6d54dbd8e">
  <data key="d3">The annual partial withdrawal allowance described in fact_sentence_1 is governed under policies issued by Horizon Wealth Protection Insurance, whose identity is confirmed in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFORMED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="ba1c52cb-9fba-4846-9a66-8e0c71e2a754">
  <data key="d3">The annual 10% partial withdrawal privilege described in fact_sentence_1 pertains to policyholder benefits, which is unrelated to the visual or administrative detail of a seal appearing on the document in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da" target="79f032d3-1299-41de-85c7-f944c1411556">
  <data key="d3">The withdrawal rule described in fact_sentence_1 is a standard policy benefit that could be referenced in documents like the one dated October 3, 2024, but it does not depend on or conflict with the document's date.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
