<edge source="628900ad-3981-4384-be18-2669a41ba276" target="4392497f-15c1-48ee-8067-43a8245bc89e">
  <data key="d3">A no-lapse guarantee rider is offered as an add-on feature to help maintain coverage without premium payments. It is unrelated to surrender charge rules, which govern fees for early cancellation.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
