  <data key="d3">The no-lapse guarantee rider exists as an optional feature, though it was not elected. Its presence does not affect the calculation or timing of surrender charges described earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
