  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="59735a62-be54-4b86-a006-cd569871d4ef" target="01ec375d-e72b-4c13-96a2-da5a23238018">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence outlines requirements for maintaining a rider’s benefit, specifically tied to consistent premium payments. This condition does not influence or relate to the fixed 10% surrender charge applied in Year 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="59735a62-be54-4b86-a006-cd569871d4ef" target="9dcea0cf-204b-429a-93cc-c257133b7890">
  <data key="d3">The No Lapse Guarantee Rider's activation depends on paying minimum guaranteed premiums, but since it was not elected, its conditionality does not affect any aspect of surrender charges or other fees tied to policy withdrawal.</data>
  <data key="d4">NOT RELATED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="59735a62-be54-4b86-a006-cd569871d4ef" target="273e0e6e-5536-4336-a312-2596a9f16c8b">
  <data key="d3">The No Lapse Guarantee Rider would remain active if premiums were maintained at the required level, but since it was not elected, its conditionality does not affect any existing features like surrender charges.</data>
  <data key="d4">NOT APPLICABLE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="59735a62-be54-4b86-a006-cd569871d4ef" target="5935cab6-342e-4e3e-9ea8-dbff499af332">
