<edge source="59735a62-be54-4b86-a006-cd569871d4ef" target="8581e6b9-7fac-4b65-a5c3-f8bf614bbe73">
  <data key="d3">The continuation of the no-lapse guarantee rider depends on paying minimum guaranteed premiums, independent of when surrender charges expire. The expiration of surrender charges has no bearing on rider status.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
