  <data key="d3">The No Lapse Guarantee Rider’s effectiveness relies on consistent premium payments, whereas surrender charges are determined solely by initial premium amounts over ten years. Neither condition directly affects the other.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
