<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="4392497f-15c1-48ee-8067-43a8245bc89e">
  <data key="d3">Failure to meet payment obligations during the grace period leads to policy lapse, independent of any surrender charge that might have applied had the policy been surrendered earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="01ec375d-e72b-4c13-96a2-da5a23238018">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay premiums within the 61-day grace period leads to policy lapse, independent of any surrender charges applied earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="9dcea0cf-204b-429a-93cc-c257133b7890">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay premiums within the 61-day grace period leads to policy lapse, independent of any surrender charge amount in Year 2.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="273e0e6e-5536-4336-a312-2596a9f16c8b">
  <data key="d3">Failure to maintain premiums triggers a policy lapse after the grace period ends, independent of surrender charges. The surrender charge level in Year 3 does not affect whether the policy lapses due to missed payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="5935cab6-342e-4e3e-9ea8-dbff499af332">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay premiums within the grace period leads to policy lapse regardless of any remaining surrender charges, making the timing of payment more critical than the surrender fee level.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="00111295-2bb8-4547-912d-c65ce0d8d633">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay premiums within the 61-day grace period leads to policy lapse regardless of any existing surrender charges, including those applicable in Year 5.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="84b84dec-45b7-4ca8-ae2f-a68466866f24">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay premiums within the 61-day grace period causes the policy to lapse. This outcome occurs independently of whether surrender charges still apply, such as the 5% charge in Year 6.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="29e19c25-f1c1-4c3e-8db6-46bce82c0dca">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay premiums within the 61-day grace period leads to policy lapse regardless of any existing surrender charges, including those applicable in Year 7.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="e9e8f00a-1414-40a5-99b4-1975b3ddee75">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay premiums within the grace period leads to policy lapse regardless of any remaining surrender charges, including those applicable in Year 8.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="fe831b43-8690-4c01-9873-79e0ef24ae00">
  <data key="d3">Failure to meet premium obligations within the 61-day grace period leads to policy lapse, independent of surrender charges. The mention of a 2% surrender charge in Year 9 does not influence or depend on this payment default outcome.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="a3cf559b-392a-434d-8391-67212bc086c3">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay the required premium within the 61-day grace period leads to policy lapse. This outcome is independent of the specific surrender charge rate applied in Year 10.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="b29caae3-f13a-4b43-af52-606c74d4bb86">
  <data key="d3">Failure to meet premium obligations despite the grace period leads to policy lapse, regardless of any remaining surrender charges that may still apply in later years like Year 11.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="8581e6b9-7fac-4b65-a5c3-f8bf614bbe73">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay the required premium within the 61-day grace period leads to policy lapse, regardless of when surrender charges expire. This outcome is independent of the timing of surrender charges.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="120104c2-987f-4f54-a944-5d235a6dd5df">
  <data key="d3">Failure to meet premium obligations leads to policy lapse after the grace period, regardless of whether surrender charges were previously applicable. This outcome does not depend on the method used to calculate those charges.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="8e4cefcc-7f56-4cf2-9f4b-3e5dc497847a">
  <data key="d3">Failure to maintain payments leads to policy lapse after the grace period ends, regardless of whether surrender charges exist or what the cash surrender value might be.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="9d636a77-9852-432c-b8fb-7593d751a2da">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay premiums leads to policy lapse regardless of whether partial withdrawals have been made.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="7011576a-0546-4f50-af7e-9f414262d88b">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay the required premium within the 61-day grace period leads to policy lapse, regardless of whether partial withdrawals have been made previously under the free withdrawal provision.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="628900ad-3981-4384-be18-2669a41ba276">
  <data key="d3">Failure to maintain premiums leads to policy lapse even though a No Lapse Guarantee Rider could have prevented it—but only if elected.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO EFFECT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="c9695180-7458-48f9-8686-914a2e999aa0">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay premiums within the grace period leads to policy lapse, which underscores why the absence of the no-lapse guarantee rider makes such lapses possible—even though the rider could have prevented them had it been chosen.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="59735a62-be54-4b86-a006-cd569871d4ef">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay the required premium within the grace period leads to policy lapse, regardless of any potential guarantees, especially since the No Lapse Guarantee Rider was not selected.</data>
  <data key="d4">NOT APPLICABLE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="d4b10129-f843-43a5-8362-ff505e1fb13b">
  <data key="d3">Failure to maintain premiums leads to policy lapse after the 61-day grace period, especially without the safety net of a No Lapse Guarantee Rider, making such lapses more likely than they would be with the rider active.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="12268e1c-c5d6-4433-beca-c792fd3b6311">
  <data key="d3">If the required premium remains unpaid beyond the 61-day grace period, the policy terminates due to non-payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONSEQUENCE_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="f693b3ab-ce04-4645-b10b-f2a647d0f872">
  <data key="d3">Failure to receive the required premium within the 61-day grace period directly causes the policy to lapse, which follows logically from earlier financial insufficiency signaled by notifications based on low account value.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="fed316a6-229f-46af-91a9-72511967565a">
  <data key="d3">If the required premium isn’t paid within the 61-day grace period, the policy lapses, resulting in termination of coverage and cancellation of future benefits. After lapse, any accumulated surrender value becomes unrecoverable.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b01976cb-788e-4005-abe5-4e8f1e57e9c3" target="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
