<edge source="c929a946-29b9-4878-9e8b-1320d6fdb4af" target="7e3f4dce-a967-443e-8c1e-f4c1a24f502c">
  <data key="d3">The statement about the policy lapsing 0 days before lapse suggests immediate termination without grace, contradicting the stated 61-day grace period. This has no clear connection to annual adjustments in participation rates, which pertain to fund allocations rather than policy survival timelines.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
