  <data key="d3">The first sentence concerns the timing of policy lapse due to non-payment, while the second explains protection against declines in fixed account interest rates. The two statements pertain to unrelated aspects of policy mechanics.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
