  <data key="d3">The grace period enables reinstatement of coverage by paying overdue premiums within 61 days, but it does not affect how dividends are calculated relative to index performance.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
