  <data key="d3">The grace period provision enables reinstatement of coverage upon late payment, independent of investment performance claims. This factual detail stands separately from warnings about historical index trends not predicting future outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
