  <data key="d3">The grace period enables reinstatement of coverage upon late payment, ensuring continuity of benefits. This does not affect the policy’s safeguard against losses from poor index performance.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
