  <data key="d3">The grace period provides a buffer for reinstating coverage without losing benefits, while the mention of 'zero' as the hero highlights how the policy protects against losses from market declines, reinforcing its risk-mitigating design.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
