  <data key="d3">The first sentence outlines the timeframe available to reinstate a policy after missing a payment. The second sentence gives general contact details for the insurance provider, which does not relate to the grace period mechanism described earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
