  <data key="d3">The first sentence outlines the payout condition for suicide within two years post-reinstatement, specifying it equals premiums paid minus withdrawals and charges. The second sentence explains that negative index performance results in no dividend distribution to the policyholder.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
