  <data key="d3">The first sentence outlines a conditional payout rule regarding suicide within two years post-reinstatement. The second sentence identifies the executive responsible for signing the document but does not relate to or influence the interpretation of the benefit condition described earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
