<edge source="66d61507-a301-4354-ad15-acfad1eafccb" target="47fe3387-29bc-4869-a3a5-637bc22b6a91">
  <data key="d3">The first sentence describes a specific claim restriction tied to suicide within two years post-reinstatement, while the second uses figurative language to highlight how zero downside risk enhances protection. Together, they reflect design elements aimed at limiting exposure and ensuring stability.</data>
  <data key="d4">THEMATIC COMPLEMENT</data>
