  <data key="d3">The existence of a two-year contestability clause does not depend on the policy being issued in Chicago, Illinois. This geographical detail has no bearing on the enforceability of the contestability provision.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1fb961d9-6574-4554-b263-906d75b3f515" target="4323367b-0222-42cb-99fe-8a2785ec96d3">
  <data key="d3">The contestability clause allows the insurer to challenge claims based on misrepresentation within two years of issuance, but it has no bearing on how dividends are calculated during periods of negative index performance.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
