<edge source="1fb961d9-6574-4554-b263-906d75b3f515" target="87987c98-b6f9-450a-8c71-84809999dd2b">
  <data key="d3">The first sentence outlines a time-bound exclusion regarding claims due to misrepresentation, while the second provides general company contact information. These statements address different topics—one regulatory/underwriting, one administrative—and do not influence each other.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
