  <data key="d3">Cap rates determine the upper limit on interest credited based on index performance. When the index declines, even if capped rates apply, no dividend participation occurs because losses aren't passed through.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
