<edge source="7e3f4dce-a967-443e-8c1e-f4c1a24f502c" target="47fe3387-29bc-4869-a3a5-637bc22b6a91">
  <data key="d3">The mention of changing participation rates reflects dynamic allocation mechanisms, while describing 'zero' as the hero highlights the safety net against market downturns. Both statements underscore structural protections embedded in the policy's design.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7e3f4dce-a967-443e-8c1e-f4c1a24f502c" target="af34274c-dfee-4fb4-a491-3e2e93de0364">
  <data key="d3">The possibility of changing participation rates reflects adjustments in how funds are distributed across investment options, whereas fixed account rates remain protected by guaranteed floors. These statements address different mechanisms of rate management—one dynamic, one static—within the same policy framework.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7e3f4dce-a967-443e-8c1e-f4c1a24f502c" target="5ba693f1-db68-45ea-a535-eef1cf763796">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 indicates that participation rates can vary yearly, affecting how gains are allocated. This variability underscores why past performance should not be relied upon when predicting future outcomes, supporting the caution expressed in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7e3f4dce-a967-443e-8c1e-f4c1a24f502c" target="4323367b-0222-42cb-99fe-8a2785ec96d3">
  <data key="d3">If the index shows negative performance, the policyholder forfeits any dividend participation regardless of the current participation rate. This limits the impact of variable participation rates under adverse market conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7e3f4dce-a967-443e-8c1e-f4c1a24f502c" target="b1733959-f2c8-49a1-abbf-c49d75d321d4">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 discusses potential annual changes in participation rates, which relates to policy financial mechanics. Fact sentence 2 provides a direct contact method for customers but does not relate to any aspect of participation rates or policy terms discussed in sentence 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7e3f4dce-a967-443e-8c1e-f4c1a24f502c" target="87987c98-b6f9-450a-8c71-84809999dd2b">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 discusses potential annual changes in participation rates, which relates to financial mechanics of the policy. Fact sentence 2 provides general contact details for the company, which does not relate to rate adjustments or policy mechanics.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
