<edge source="7e3f4dce-a967-443e-8c1e-f4c1a24f502c" target="1b5bac8e-3dbc-4701-8ee4-2896a945787f">
  <data key="d3">The statement about fluctuating participation rates reflects ongoing policy management dynamics unrelated to executive authorization. No connection exists between rate adjustments and the CEO’s signature on the document.</data>
