  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 discusses potential annual adjustments to fixed account interest rates, which relates to financial terms of the policy. Fact sentence 2 provides a direct line of communication for customers but does not relate to rate changes or any aspect of account mechanics.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
