<edge source="09f59f75-d8f5-4cf9-b763-8e9b77770ca0" target="4323367b-0222-42cb-99fe-8a2785ec96d3">
  <data key="d3">The possibility of annual changes to fixed account rates pertains to interest crediting on the fixed portion of the policy. This has no bearing on whether the policyholder receives dividends when the index performs negatively, as dividend eligibility depends solely on index-linked performance rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
