  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 highlights that past index performance is not indicative of future outcomes, reinforcing caution in interpreting historical trends. Fact sentence 1 complements this by showing that even stable-sounding fixed rates can fluctuate yearly, adding another layer to long-term return unpredictability.</data>
