  <data key="d3">Describing 'zero' as the hero underscores the safety net of guaranteed minimum returns and no losses from index declines, complementing the contestability clause by reinforcing trust in policy integrity despite potential inaccuracies at inception.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
