  <data key="d3">Describing 'zero' as the hero signifies the absence of downside risk from index declines, which complements the idea that participation rates might vary annually without affecting principal protection.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
