  <data key="d3">The assertion that "zero is the hero" reflects the design principle behind the guaranteed minimum rate, where zero serves as a buffer preventing any negative impact from market downturns, thus underpinning the reliability of the cap rate floor.</data>
  <data key="d4">UNDERPINS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
